	(text_box "Vs is sensitive to noise. Increased noise will increase measurement error. If Vs and Vdd i/o share the same source, it can lead to clock noise on the Vs line. If we are stuck with a noisy voltage source for Vs then there are things we can do in the accelerometer schematic to mitigate the issue.\n\nAdditionally, Vs prefers to be at 2.5v, although it will function between 1.6v and 3.3v."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
